                <pb facs="0887" n="791" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg791"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Loomis.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November 18,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Three hundred and forty-five received. Insist on ship’s papers being delivered to
                    the United States consul, in accordance with practice of modern nations. Invite
                    coincident action by other ministers.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
